Thumbs.db

# NOTE: data/ (including data/faiss_index/) is intentionally NOT
# ignored. The scheduled GitHub Actions workflow
# (.github/workflows/update-knowledge-base.yml) runs the full
# pipeline — including rebuilding the FAISS index — and commits
# everything back automatically, so no manual step is needed after
# an automated refresh.